CodeAgent Studio

This product is an independent implementation. CloudCLI/claudecodeui is used
only as a behavioral reference; no CloudCLI source code is included.

Third-party notices
-------------------
At the time of this MVP, no third-party source files are copied into the
runtime packages. If a VS Code MIT file is later copied, its original
copyright header and MIT license must be retained here with the source URL,
fixed commit SHA, copy date, and local wrapper path.

Reference repositories (not runtime dependencies):
- https://github.com/siteboon/claudecodeui (AGPL-3.0-or-later; reference only)
- https://github.com/coder/code-server (MIT; reference only)
